 target('GraniteCave_StevensRoom_Text_IveGotToHurryAlong',"I'm heading east. MAGMA and AQUA\nare disturbing more than land and sea.\\pInspect the marked stone in the\nlower cave. COBALION may answer\nonce you hold the STONE BADGE.\\pDEVON's researcher keeps optional\nclues. You can explore without him."),
