 target('Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_PokemonChangesWithWeather',"CASTFORM changes with the weather.\nLet it show you what a storm can do.\\pInvestigate SIGNS as you explore.\nDEVON's researcher offers clues\nwhenever you want some guidance."),
 target('Route119_WeatherInstitute_2F_Text_ChangingWeatherRidiculous',"Our instruments still trace that\nold network beneath HOENN.\\pDEVON's lab has optional leads for\nthe SIGNS you want to investigate.\\pThe road north leads to FORTREE.\nYou're welcome to rest here."),
